+-- its cuff edge is lit magma over an ash frill at the wrist, with a close glove
+-- and one lit seam across the knuckles.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+-- The mountain's devotees: dark basalt, pale ash and magma red in the seams,
+-- with the sleeve a shade darker than the gown.
